<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="518895995"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1648682516"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Take Me With You"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Fleurie / Ruslan"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Take Me With You"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:58.000"><div begin="00:22.373" end="03:23.210"><p begin="00:22.373" end="00:26.193" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Hear it first in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这旋律第一次在脑海里回响</span></p><p begin="00:26.193" end="00:29.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">See us spinning like a silhouette<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着我们像剪影一样旋转</span></p><p begin="00:29.815" end="00:33.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Like dreamers chase a world beyond<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是不断超越世界的逐梦者</span></p><p begin="00:33.565" end="00:35.516" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">I taste your taste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我品味着你的所爱 唱着你唱过的歌</span></p><p begin="00:35.516" end="00:37.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I sing your song</p><p begin="00:39.421" end="00:41.785" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I need to know, need to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要知道</span></p><p begin="00:43.300" end="00:46.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Swear to me you're not a ghost<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我发誓 你不是鬼</span></p><p begin="00:46.963" end="00:49.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Through paradise or hell you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飘荡于天堂和地狱之间 你知道的</span></p><p begin="00:52.005" end="00:57.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">You can go on, go on, go on, go on, go on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以继续翱翔</span></p><p begin="00:59.616" end="01:04.518" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">You can go on, go on, go on, go on, go on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以继续翱翔</span></p><p begin="01:06.794" end="01:08.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Just take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起</span></p><p begin="01:10.810" end="01:11.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起 带上我一起 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="01:14.491" end="01:15.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="01:17.900" end="01:19.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="01:24.389" end="01:26.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Your love is like a waterfall<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的爱就像瀑布</span></p><p begin="01:28.414" end="01:30.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Crashing down so wonderful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飞流直下 落在我心田 美不胜收</span></p><p begin="01:32.169" end="01:34.286" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I just want you to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是想让你知道</span></p><p begin="01:36.824" end="01:42.111" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">You can go on, go on, go on, go on, go on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以继续翱翔</span></p><p begin="01:44.430" end="01:49.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">You can go on, go on, go on, go on, go on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以继续翱翔</span></p><p begin="01:49.913" end="01:53.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Just take me with you</p><p begin="01:55.404" end="01:57.088" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起 带上我一起 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="01:59.026" end="02:00.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Just take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="02:03.370" end="02:04.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="02:06.968" end="02:08.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="02:10.787" end="02:11.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="02:14.777" end="02:15.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="02:18.330" end="02:19.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="02:22.946" end="02:25.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Face to face, midnight glow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直面午夜的光辉</span></p><p begin="02:25.880" end="02:29.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Tracing patterns in the sky below<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐天空下的美丽</span></p><p begin="02:29.781" end="02:33.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Like dreamers chase a world beyond<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是不断超越世界的逐梦者</span></p><p begin="02:33.822" end="02:35.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I taste your taste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我品味着你的所爱 唱着你唱过的歌</span></p><p begin="02:35.517" end="02:37.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I sing your song</p><p begin="02:37.096" end="02:39.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="02:40.431" end="02:42.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="02:43.423" end="02:44.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I sing your song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我唱着你唱过的歌 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="02:48.073" end="02:51.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Take me with, take me with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起</span></p><p begin="02:51.643" end="02:53.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Just take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起</span></p><p begin="02:55.837" end="02:57.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起 带上我一起 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="02:59.528" end="03:00.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="03:03.241" end="03:04.437" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="03:07.065" end="03:08.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起 带上我一起 带上我一起</span></p><p begin="03:10.784" end="03:11.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="03:14.319" end="03:15.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Just take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要带上我一起前行</span></p><p begin="03:18.346" end="03:19.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起</span></p><p begin="03:22.060" end="03:23.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Take me with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上我一起</span></p></div></body></tt>